cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this template for your thesis, please cite it as below."
title: "NITDGP-Thesis-Template-Unofficial: Professional LaTeX Template for NIT Durgapur Thesis (UG/PG/PhD)"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-03-22"
abstract: >
  An unofficial, professional-grade LaTeX thesis template designed for undergraduate,
  postgraduate, and doctoral students at National Institute of Technology Durgapur (NIT Durgapur).
  The template provides automated formatting, multi-student support (up to 3 students for UG,
  1 for PG/PhD), latexmk integration, MATLAB code highlighting, and full institutional compliance
  with academic presentation standards. It is an alumni initiative developed to ease the
  thesis-writing process for the NITDGP community.
